0516a000-c8e2-422f-9984-81dcb110d7a6-0
00:28:54.240 --> 00:28:57.440
So we can be community navigators for
rural New Mexico patients.

062a218c-3061-4e09-be27-32798e70c144-0
00:28:57.800 --> 00:29:01.921
So people that are way out that may have
a hard time waiting for a clinician or

062a218c-3061-4e09-be27-32798e70c144-1
00:29:01.921 --> 00:29:06.093
seeing a clinician on a regular basis,
perhaps there's a doula in that area or a

062a218c-3061-4e09-be27-32798e70c144-2
00:29:06.093 --> 00:29:08.000
doula willing to travel to that area.

196971fd-5ee8-4827-bb99-4f766637235b-0
00:29:08.280 --> 00:29:11.160
And it would be much less expensive to to
cover that cost.

60e6a20c-cef9-4872-8f54-2f06b4c7d099-0
00:29:12.640 --> 00:29:17.791
We can also work as kind of cultural
translators and and navigators between

60e6a20c-cef9-4872-8f54-2f06b4c7d099-1
00:29:17.791 --> 00:29:21.994
indigenous communities,
which are very often these low income

60e6a20c-cef9-4872-8f54-2f06b4c7d099-2
00:29:21.994 --> 00:29:27.417
rural indigenous communities have very
good reason to be distrustful of medical

60e6a20c-cef9-4872-8f54-2f06b4c7d099-3
00:29:27.417 --> 00:29:27.960
systems.

b07848f8-16d5-444b-947a-6050f70ce8f1-0
00:29:28.440 --> 00:29:32.955
And so having a layperson,
someone outside of the system helping

b07848f8-16d5-444b-947a-6050f70ce8f1-1
00:29:32.955 --> 00:29:38.444
navigate and translate can help kind of
bridge that gap and increase trust and

b07848f8-16d5-444b-947a-6050f70ce8f1-2
00:29:38.444 --> 00:29:39.000
comfort.

87e43886-f81e-4880-a61a-096dadc20abf-0
00:29:39.000 --> 00:29:40.160
Comfort with the system.

0d67b347-ff7b-4314-97aa-cee2e74e9416-0
00:29:41.840 --> 00:29:44.570
Again,
using plain language and informed consent

0d67b347-ff7b-4314-97aa-cee2e74e9416-1
00:29:44.570 --> 00:29:47.914
types of support,
which lowers the barrier of access to the

0d67b347-ff7b-4314-97aa-cee2e74e9416-2
00:29:47.914 --> 00:29:48.360
program.

826bdaca-28f2-4352-8ae6-130128657dc5-0
00:29:49.440 --> 00:29:52.960
Then doulas also help extend family and
caregiver support.

0db23358-1d85-4983-b202-65186e2d205c-0
00:29:53.920 --> 00:29:57.804
Doulas are specifically trained to not
just work with the person that's dying,

0db23358-1d85-4983-b202-65186e2d205c-1
00:29:57.804 --> 00:29:59.280
but their care circle as well.

79a6f209-e9d7-4e72-b54e-fb313d0b99f2-0
00:29:59.280 --> 00:30:03.840
That's part of of what we're taught to do
from the very beginning.

2cc03ace-3e51-49a9-a757-87860d336537-0
00:30:04.200 --> 00:30:09.829
And so we can help prepare families for
the client or patients possible changes

2cc03ace-3e51-49a9-a757-87860d336537-1
00:30:09.829 --> 00:30:13.629
in worldview,
helping them interpret their paid their

2cc03ace-3e51-49a9-a757-87860d336537-2
00:30:13.629 --> 00:30:15.600
their loved ones experience.

5c25679f-2ffd-4ba8-a0cb-c0184561e641-0
00:30:17.840 --> 00:30:23.254
We are experts in helping reduce
caregiver anxiety and confusion through a

5c25679f-2ffd-4ba8-a0cb-c0184561e641-1
00:30:23.254 --> 00:30:26.720
sense of grounding support,
but also education.

648b6fc8-7d3e-4e39-8978-3b2e96b43ef3-0
00:30:27.120 --> 00:30:31.381
I think education is absolutely key to
reducing anxiety throughout the end of

648b6fc8-7d3e-4e39-8978-3b2e96b43ef3-1
00:30:31.381 --> 00:30:34.277
life process,
both for the person that's leaving and

648b6fc8-7d3e-4e39-8978-3b2e96b43ef3-2
00:30:34.277 --> 00:30:35.480
for their care circle.

b409d91c-5cc0-41e4-a84d-36b1769afc45-0
00:30:36.320 --> 00:30:39.729
And then we're also again,
already trained in facilitating these

b409d91c-5cc0-41e4-a84d-36b1769afc45-1
00:30:39.729 --> 00:30:42.720
challenging conversations that may come
up post session.

18511900-cdd0-4e73-9b93-17abae7b091f-0
00:30:44.080 --> 00:30:46.880
And then again,
we can provide bereavement continuity.

bcb67b5a-3ef0-4fe7-85d7-15ac1ea19798-0
00:30:47.120 --> 00:30:51.872
I find working with my clients that they,
they find it a lot of comfort in talking

bcb67b5a-3ef0-4fe7-85d7-15ac1ea19798-1
00:30:51.872 --> 00:30:56.624
to me about their grief because they know
that I knew their loved 1 and I may have

bcb67b5a-3ef0-4fe7-85d7-15ac1ea19798-2
00:30:56.624 --> 00:30:59.601
even been present when they took their
last breath,

bcb67b5a-3ef0-4fe7-85d7-15ac1ea19798-3
00:30:59.601 --> 00:31:03.952
which can feel incredibly supportive to
someone as opposed to coming in and

bcb67b5a-3ef0-4fe7-85d7-15ac1ea19798-4
00:31:03.952 --> 00:31:07.560
talking to a complete stranger about
someone that you've lost.

e04d81d6-9971-40bf-b6b2-3c74424df72b-0
00:31:10.880 --> 00:31:15.605
So kind of the harder questions and the
things that I think that are really

e04d81d6-9971-40bf-b6b2-3c74424df72b-1
00:31:15.605 --> 00:31:20.454
important to acknowledge and that are
really important for me to kind of help

e04d81d6-9971-40bf-b6b2-3c74424df72b-2
00:31:20.454 --> 00:31:24.682
us tease apart and figure out coming from
a medical side of things,

e04d81d6-9971-40bf-b6b2-3c74424df72b-3
00:31:24.682 --> 00:31:29.470
coming from a career where I was licensed
and I was in a regulated industry,

e04d81d6-9971-40bf-b6b2-3c74424df72b-4
00:31:29.470 --> 00:31:34.320
it's really important that we define the
role of a doula within this program.

ef12b32b-da9e-42de-bd45-fddf203653fe-0
00:31:35.080 --> 00:31:38.720
And so some of the concerns are scope
creep and clinical overlap.

34cf13e6-de15-4e64-9a06-5c5601150140-0
00:31:39.880 --> 00:31:45.298
And so a proposed safeguard there would
be that we explicitly define the non

34cf13e6-de15-4e64-9a06-5c5601150140-1
00:31:45.298 --> 00:31:47.480
clinical role of a death doula.

ec248834-d260-4d0e-a15d-83e8e0b2d1bd-0
00:31:47.720 --> 00:31:51.631
Again, what we do and what we do not do,
what is permitted is what is not

ec248834-d260-4d0e-a15d-83e8e0b2d1bd-1
00:31:51.631 --> 00:31:52.160
permitted.

4eb440cd-7314-4f0f-8c2a-75031f598a62-0
00:31:53.680 --> 00:31:58.170
The fact that we are not licensed as
doulas and I don't think I mentioned that

4eb440cd-7314-4f0f-8c2a-75031f598a62-1
00:31:58.170 --> 00:32:00.160
in the very beginning, I apologize.

5fb58c77-5e5e-4dbd-a73f-544b293c6b76-0
00:32:00.880 --> 00:32:05.560
Doulas are certified through whatever
training program that they took.

50e93440-89bf-4fc9-ba89-6c5eb2abd112-0
00:32:05.840 --> 00:32:11.600
There is currently no overarching
regulatory body or licensure for doulas.

b9b1616c-371b-4aaf-ab20-0da430c6d46b-0
00:32:11.920 --> 00:32:16.023
It's almost similar to a life coach where
almost anyone can call themselves a life

b9b1616c-371b-4aaf-ab20-0da430c6d46b-1
00:32:16.023 --> 00:32:16.320
coach.

8f73660f-13fb-457a-9a16-0603ac3527a7-0
00:32:16.760 --> 00:32:21.830
So it's going to be really important to
put in place some competency based

8f73660f-13fb-457a-9a16-0603ac3527a7-1
00:32:21.830 --> 00:32:27.441
training requirements and as some sort of
a voluntary registry of these folks that

8f73660f-13fb-457a-9a16-0603ac3527a7-2
00:32:27.441 --> 00:32:31.160
have gone through whatever approved
training programs.

460f9031-9709-4408-bcdf-72e8075a5958-0
00:32:32.280 --> 00:32:36.115
There is some precedence for this and
we'll talk about it a little bit more

460f9031-9709-4408-bcdf-72e8075a5958-1
00:32:36.115 --> 00:32:40.002
later through Birth Doulas where there
are multiple different tracks through

460f9031-9709-4408-bcdf-72e8075a5958-2
00:32:40.002 --> 00:32:44.039
which they can be certified in order to
receive reimbursement through Medicaid.

df7eb0b3-a4d6-4c72-8fe2-c1a4f7f6b5eb-0
00:32:44.320 --> 00:32:46.280
And we'll dive into that a little bit
more in a moment.

ed4d07c0-192a-46fb-bcb8-da9065b589d1-0
00:32:48.200 --> 00:32:51.693
There's also some overlap with the role
of the clinician,

ed4d07c0-192a-46fb-bcb8-da9065b589d1-1
00:32:51.693 --> 00:32:53.560
the licensed practitioner here.

54e86458-dddd-4efa-86fc-f582b42053ad-0
00:32:53.800 --> 00:32:57.213
And so again,
it'll be really important to clearly

54e86458-dddd-4efa-86fc-f582b42053ad-1
00:32:57.213 --> 00:33:02.433
differentiate in our language the role of
the clinician versus a doula or non

54e86458-dddd-4efa-86fc-f582b42053ad-2
00:33:02.433 --> 00:33:04.040
licensed support person.

f92f2344-7d0f-4245-96e1-89b75a4b238d-0
00:33:05.160 --> 00:33:10.275
And the fact that that the clinician's
role is generally episodic where this non

f92f2344-7d0f-4245-96e1-89b75a4b238d-1
00:33:10.275 --> 00:33:14.000
licensed support person,
the death doula is a longitudinal

f92f2344-7d0f-4245-96e1-89b75a4b238d-2
