relationship that continues throughout
the entire arc of end of life concerns

f92f2344-7d0f-4245-96e1-89b75a4b238d-3
00:33:18.926 --> 00:33:21.200
around liability and accountability.

235f24b6-a49d-4087-a1e4-5a637cbb96b9-0
00:33:21.800 --> 00:33:24.560
Again,
it's gonna be really important to make

235f24b6-a49d-4087-a1e4-5a637cbb96b9-1
00:33:24.560 --> 00:33:29.420
this a team based care model so that the
non licensed person is never working on

235f24b6-a49d-4087-a1e4-5a637cbb96b9-2
00:33:29.420 --> 00:33:31.760
their own or facilitating on their own.

3398bbff-093f-4603-b5c1-7383abce1696-0
00:33:31.760 --> 00:33:36.845
That they are always working either under
or alongside a a licensed clinician,

3398bbff-093f-4603-b5c1-7383abce1696-1
00:33:36.845 --> 00:33:41.672
That it is a team based model and that
